  "description": "In a quiet neighborhood, there's a small store where people too tired to remove their own makeup come to visit. Run by the cool and chic CEO \"Huey\" and her cheerful part-timer \"Sooyeon\", the makeup removal specialty shop named \"Huey Soft Cleansing\" soothes both the heart and skin of the customers who visit the shop. A romantic aesthetic romance for the clean and mature minded women!! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
